Subject: [PATCH 070/254] NVIDIA: SAUCE: tegra-epl: add periodic alive packet
 functionality

Add periodic alive packet thread to maintain continuous communication with FSI:

- Add periodic alive packet thread that sends keep-alive messages every 10ms
- Implement thread management functions (start/stop) for suspend/resume/remove operations
- Add thread state tracking with alive_packet_thread_running flag
- Send alive packet data {0x44415441, 0x48414B45, 0x414E4453, 0x45504C48} to FSI
- Only send alive packets when handshake is successful and HSP channel is valid
- Add proper error handling and logging for thread creation and message sending
- Integrate thread lifecycle management into power management operations
- Start thread after successful initial handshake in probe
- Stop thread during suspend, shutdown, and remove operations
- Restart thread after successful resume handshake

The periodic alive packet ensures continuous communication with FSI and helps
maintain the connection state during normal operation and power management cycles.

FSIS-2881

